@startuml
title MaquiControl - Billing Management Bounded Context\nDesign-Level Event Storming

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleFontSize 12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

' ===== Actor -> Command -> Aggregate -> Domain Event =====
rectangle "COMMAND\nCalculate Rental Amount" as CMD_CALCULATE_RENTAL_AMOUNT #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nInvoice" as AGG_INVOICE_0 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nRental Amount Calculated" as EVT_RENTAL_AMOUNT_CALCULATED #FFB74D
rectangle "COMMAND\nIssue Electronic Invoice" as CMD_ISSUE_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nInvoice" as AGG_INVOICE_1 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nElectronic Invoice Issued" as EVT_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE_ISSUED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nApply Late Penalty" as CMD_APPLY_LATE_PENALTY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nLate Penalty" as AGG_LATE_PENALTY_2 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nLate Penalty Applied" as EVT_LATE_PENALTY_APPLIED #FFB74D

' ===== Policies =====
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Operations)\nService Operation Completed" as XEVT_SERVICE_OPERATION_COMPLETED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen the service operation is completed,\ncalculate the rental amount" as POL_0 #B39DDB
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen the amount is calculated,\nissue the electronic invoice" as POL_1 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Rental)\nRental Completed" as XEVT_RENTAL_COMPLETED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a rental ends after its\nagreed date, apply a late penalty" as POL_2 #B39DDB

' ===== Read Models =====
rectangle "READ MODEL\nInvoice Details\n<size:10><i>Query: View Invoice</i></size>" as RM_0 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_RM_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nInvoice History\n<size:10><i>Query: View Invoice History</i></size>" as RM_1 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_RM_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nLate Penalties\n<size:10><i>Query: View Late Penalties</i></size>" as RM_2 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_RM_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "EXTERNAL SYSTEM\nSUNAT" as EXT_0 #E78AD9
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nSUNAT may reject or delay\nthe electronic invoice" as HOT_0 #EF9A9A

CMD_CALCULATE_RENTAL_AMOUNT --> AGG_INVOICE_0
AGG_INVOICE_0 --> EVT_RENTAL_AMOUNT_CALCULATED
note bottom of AGG_INVOICE_0
<b>Business rules (Invoice)</b>
- Amount = validated hours x hourly rate
- References the rental by its id
- An invoice is issued only once
  per rental
end note
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 --> CMD_ISSUE_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE
CMD_ISSUE_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE --> AGG_INVOICE_1
AGG_INVOICE_1 --> EVT_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE_ISSUED
CMD_APPLY_LATE_PENALTY --> AGG_LATE_PENALTY_2
AGG_LATE_PENALTY_2 --> EVT_LATE_PENALTY_APPLIED
note bottom of AGG_LATE_PENALTY_2
<b>Business rules (Late Penalty)</b>
- Applies only when machinery is
  returned after the agreed end date
end note
XEVT_SERVICE_OPERATION_COMPLETED --> POL_0
POL_0 --> CMD_CALCULATE_RENTAL_AMOUNT
EVT_RENTAL_AMOUNT_CALCULATED --> POL_1
POL_1 --> CMD_ISSUE_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE
XEVT_RENTAL_COMPLETED --> POL_2
POL_2 --> CMD_APPLY_LATE_PENALTY
EVT_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE_ISSUED ..> RM_0 : updates
RM_0 ..> ACT_RM_0 : informs
EVT_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE_ISSUED ..> RM_1 : updates
RM_1 ..> ACT_RM_1 : informs
EVT_LATE_PENALTY_APPLIED ..> RM_2 : updates
RM_2 ..> ACT_RM_2 : informs
CMD_ISSUE_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE .. EXT_0
HOT_0 .. EVT_ELECTRONIC_INVOICE_ISSUED

legend right
|= Color |= Element |
|<#FFF9C4>| Actor |
|<#87CEFA>| Command |
|<#FFF59D>| Aggregate |
|<#FFB74D>| Domain Event |
|<#B39DDB>| Policy |
|<#81C784>| Read Model |
|<#FFE0B2>| Domain Event from another Bounded Context |
|<#E78AD9>| External System |
|<#EF9A9A>| Hotspot |
|<#FFFDE7>| Business Rules (note) |
endlegend

@enduml
